# ACL do Mosquitto - Smart Energy Manager (prefixo comm.mqtt_prefix = smartenergy)
# Principio do menor privilegio:
#   - dispositivo (ESP32) e gemeo digital PUBLICAM telemetria/eventos/decisoes/acks e ASSINAM cmd;
#   - backend ASSINA o que o dispositivo publica e PUBLICA cmd (+ decisoes do MPC);
#   - monitor (Grafana/Node-RED/healthcheck) apenas le.
# Usuarios sem regra nao tem acesso a nenhum topico.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- dispositivo
user sem-device
topic write smartenergy/telemetry
topic write smartenergy/pv/#
topic write smartenergy/battery/#
topic write smartenergy/load/#
topic write smartenergy/ems/mode
topic write smartenergy/ems/decision
topic write smartenergy/system/status
topic write smartenergy/system/event
topic write smartenergy/cmd/ack
topic read smartenergy/cmd

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- gemeo digital (dados SIMULADOS)
user sem-twin
topic write smartenergy/telemetry
topic write smartenergy/pv/#
topic write smartenergy/battery/#
topic write smartenergy/load/#
topic write smartenergy/ems/mode
topic write smartenergy/ems/decision
topic write smartenergy/system/status
topic write smartenergy/system/event
topic write smartenergy/cmd/ack
topic read smartenergy/cmd

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- backend (ingest, API, live-ems)
user sem-backend
topic read smartenergy/telemetry
topic read smartenergy/pv/#
topic read smartenergy/battery/#
topic read smartenergy/load/#
topic read smartenergy/ems/#
topic read smartenergy/system/#
topic read smartenergy/cmd/ack
topic write smartenergy/cmd
topic write smartenergy/ems/decision

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- somente leitura
user sem-monitor
topic read smartenergy/#
topic read $SYS/#
